69:In this section, we introduce multimodal soft-introspective VAE (mmSIVAE), extending SIVAE (Daniel and Tamar, 2021) to the multimodal setting. First, we present the theoretical analysis of mmSIVAE, followed by modeling of the joint latent posterior using the Mixture-of-Product-of-Experts (MOPOE) technique. Next, we discuss how mmSIVAE can be adopted for multimodal normative modeling which includes model training, inference and calculation of subject-level deviations.
